      ],
      "responseContract": "appcall-provider-json-v1",
      "adaptations": [
        "Credential-only healthcheck maps to GET /zones, a cheap defined-action read. The pinned validator prefers GET /user/tokens/verify and falls back to GET /zones?page=1&per_page=1; native uses GET /zones so account-owned tokens still authenticate.",
        "Native category is dev-tools (source Developer Tools/Security; security is not in Rust CATEGORIES).",
        "HTTP 200 bodies with a populated errors array are demoted via bodyErrorPaths [errors]. success is not used because true would false-fail.",
        "The upstream user-agent is not sent. OAuth2 is omitted; this recipe is API-token only."
      ]
    },
